compactionPrompt.text:
Preserve:
- current human goal;
- immutable governance constraints and approvals;
- current profile, phase, target, base, workspace, and execution identifiers;
- activated skills and activation reasons;
- verified facts with evidence references;
- open questions and required evidence;
- accepted decisions;
- rejected hypotheses with closing evidence;
- next bounded actions and artifact paths.

Discard or aggressively summarize:
- raw tool transcripts;
- complete diffs and file bodies;
- repeated evidence;
- resolved exploration;
- superseded plans;
- inactive skill instructions;
- examples and explanatory text from already-applied Mana documents;
- full Jira, GitHub, test, and log payloads.

Never turn an assumption or inference into a verified fact.
Never remove an unresolved blocker, approval gate, safety constraint, or provenance.
